== DCE check (does the unreached layout core drop?) ==
yoga_min - yoga_one = 84561 B  (82.6 KiB)
   both link the SAME libyoga.a; a modest positive gap means the layout core is
   pulled in only when reached, i.e. wasm-ld's GC-sections is working.

